      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You say, “Claude, start a doc for this plan.” Claude writes up what the team has said so far, and teammates on the invite can edit the plan while you keep talking.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-meetings",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z",
