      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude asks for their approval to look it up, posts it in the meeting chat, and compares it to the current plan.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-meetings",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:30.734Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Later, you can go back to meetings you were part of and ask Claude about them, or add Claude to the next one from your calendar in claude.ai.",
