        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:30.734Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On Team plans, inviting Claude to your meetings is available by default, and an admin can turn it off.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/claude-meetings",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T13:27:30.734Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "While it’s in beta, it isn’t available to some organizations, including those with zero data retention (ZDR), HIPAA-ready configuration, or customer-managed encryption keys (CMEK).",
